    qudt:hasDimensionVector <http://qudt.org/vocab/dimensionvector/A0E0L2I0M1H0T0D0> ;
    qudt:plainTextDescription """
  The quantity kind 'Product of Inertia in the Y axis' is a measure of a body's 
