        "Hertz por Kelvin"@pt,
        "Hertz pe Kelvin"@ro,
        "Герц на Кельвин"@ru,
        "Hertz na Kelvin"@sl,
        "Hertz per Kelvin"@tr ;
    dcterms:description """
  $\\textit{Hertz per Kelvin}$ is a unit for 'Inverse Time Temperature' expressed as $Hz K^{-1}$.
